{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Phase-1 confirmed RCA before repair. H1: whole-tree fixtures amplify a four-value build-hook contract; live macOS records total at least 56.93 named worker-seconds across fallback/shared/preserve/blank probes, while local profiling attributes 3.85-4.32s to full python build plus 1.37-1.53s to indexing per fallback. Same unchanged production hook on a minimal committed Hatch package preserved the exact fallback SHA while cutting initial paired totals from 6.30/9.26s to 2.66/5.43s. H2: runtime -n 3 --dist worksteal assigned three built_artifacts consumers to gw0/gw1/gw2; every worker initialized its session fixture, with 6.60-6.74s setup each, proving three full builds rather than one. H3 correctness prerequisite: run 31874837464 supplied patchset 9aecb53e, checked HEAD out to 9aecb53e, but _artifact-probe built with workflow GITHUB_SHA 7d908fbb; truthiness-only wheel/sdist assertions passed the wrong nonempty provenance. This violates ducal-statuelike-ladybird exact-source identity. The parsimonious repair is one shared minimal actual-hook fixture for cross-platform semantics plus the existing full-project artifact job hardened to derive git rev-parse --short HEAD after either final checkout and assert exact equality. It preserves every platform, Python cell, isolated PEP 517 boundary, behavior, assertion, import/CLI/schema probe, selector, worker, coverage, mutation, runner, and vote dependency. OSS placement is 4/4 consensus: pytest 68308aa, pip f399c371, Poetry 92b74dc, Pydantic 02c5c975. Signed plan review PASS at material fingerprint 043e782b7606201c. Advisory disposition: timing evidence compares against the RCA paired 6.30/9.26s full-tree baseline and remains informational, never a pass threshold."},"env_id":"0993f6a8-7a6a-4707-a671-c5bbb2691444","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786787013476936001,"uuid":"582cf4d0-8bad-473a-b892-0b42bac6d553"}